atoId":"Y1blDx2KT1yTUiBq_wnExQ","name":"Barre énergétique fruitée","form":"solid","info":{"quantity":{"value":1,"metric":"item"},"cho":{"value":30,"metric":"g"},"sodium":{"value":0,"metric":"mg"}}}]]}}},"stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":3240},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1200,"pace":{"value":327}},{"kind":"Z3","duration":180,"pace":{"value":317}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":339}},{"kind":"Z3","duration":180,"pace":{"value":317}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":339}},{"kind":"Z3","duration":180,"pace":{"value":317}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":339}},{"kind":"Z3","duration":180,"pace":{"value":317}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":339}},{"kind":"Z3","duration":180,"pace":{"value":317}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":339}},{"kind":"Z3","duration":180,"pace":{"value":317}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":339}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":600,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le rythme doit être confortable. Adapte ton allure à la forme du jour pour que le ressenti de la séance reste vraiment facile.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Rien de tel qu’un footing pour décompresser ou t’échapper un peu du quotidien. Regarde autour de toi, savoure l’instant, et laisse-toi porter par le plaisir simple de courir. Parfois, ça fait du bien de revenir à l’essentiel ! ","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":327,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1791158400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_45+6LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Quelques lignes droites en plus du traditionnel footing. De quoi te faire plaisir car il n'y a aucun objectif d'allure, juste de sentir que ton corps se libère et te permet d'accélérer progressivement de ligne droite en ligne droite !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_39","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":327,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":39,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VO2max","value":211,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"vo2max","context":"intensity","perception":"very-high"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_Indif_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name"